Date: Tue, 8 Sep 2026 00:19:10 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3432/3799] soh: rename D_80125B1C -> sMagicMeterColors

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence GUESS) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: rows of three s16 in Interface_Draw beside the magic meter drawing; read as its colour sets
Defined in soh/src/code/z_parameter.c.

Tagged [LLM:GUESS] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/code/z_parameter.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/code/z_parameter.c b/soh/src/code/z_parameter.c
index a76309a4b..467bb7c50 100644
--- a/soh/src/code/z_parameter.c
+++ b/soh/src/code/z_parameter.c
@@ -5113,7 +5113,7 @@ void Interface_Draw(PlayState* play) {
     static s16 timerDigitLeftPos[] = { 16, 25, 34, 42, 51 };
     static s16 digitWidth[] = { 9, 9, 8, 9, 9 };
     // unused, most likely colors
-    static s16 D_80125B1C[][3] = {
+    static s16 sMagicMeterColors[][3] = {  // was D_80125B1C [LLM:GUESS]
         { 0, 150, 0 }, { 100, 255, 0 }, { 255, 255, 255 }, { 0, 0, 0 }, { 255, 255, 255 },
     };
     static s16 rupeeDigitsFirst[] = { 1, 0, 0, 0 };
